    <string name="peak_method_desc">Highlights sharp areas in the viewfinder. Auto: only during manual focus.</string>
    <string name="show_afdata_desc">What to show over the viewfinder: HUD (shutter, ISO, focus, white balance), histogram or AF / AE boxes.</string>
    <string name="cfa_desc">Order of the colour pixels of the sensor. Auto: as the camera reports; a wrong one breaks colours.</string>
    <string name="color_method_desc">Where the colour matrix comes from: the camera calibration or each shot. Changes the colours.</string>
